! v0.76.0 acceptance test: OH/BPW91/cc-pVDZ.  In v0.75.1 this
! sometimes hit a false-positive "converged" with dP > ptol after a
! large dE swing.  With SAD + the new convergence criterion the SCF
! must converge with |g| < 1e-5 in ~ 15-20 iterations.
%method  BPW91
%basis   cc-pVDZ
%job     energy
%grid    tm
%charge  0
%mult    2
%spherical

%geo
O  0.0  0.0  0.00
H  0.0  0.0  0.98
